OL,3,GNEWSASeal sanctuary takes in first pup
OL,4,Aof the season
OL,5,
OL,6,FA seal sanctuary has taken in its first
OL,7,Fpup of the season, a grey female it has
OL,8,Fnamed Babybel.
OL,10,FThe pup was rescued from Port Gaverne
OL,11,Fon 6 August, when its mother did not
OL,12,Freturn to nurse and it became
OL,13,Fincreasingly weak.
OL,15,FMammal medics from the Cornish Seal
OL,16,FSanctuary had monitored the pup for 48
OL,17,Fhours before stepping in to rescue the
OL,18,Fpup thought to be about seven days old.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
